WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to The Switch admin. Let's start by signing in.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
On switchme.io, Sign in is the last item in the top bar.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
You can continue with Google, or use your email and password.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Type your email, then your password. It shows as dots.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Press Sign in, and the admin opens on Overview.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Your account is at the top right. That's also where you sign out.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The admin menu runs down the left side. Everything you need starts here.
